35,2,1,talk,May,,The tally shows two people used it eleven times. The rest of us only four. It is not shared.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The wall is thin. I can hear everything. Also, unplanned talk has stopped since the sofa went in.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,Eleven callouts last year. The room is a magnet for repairs. That is a lot of hidden labor.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The invoices show we paid 68,000 yen for nine bookings. The fit-out quotes are high too.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The last awkward talk happened across the desks. Everyone heard it. That is why we are quiet now.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if the wall is that bad, a quiet room might just move the noise problem to the office.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the crumbs are everywhere. Three keyboards have food under the keys. It is messy.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, 68,000 yen is significant. If we fit it out, we add to that cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, the quotes are 141,000 for a meeting space and 96,000 for a kitchen. Both are steep.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, the lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes. People eat here because they are hungry and tired.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"So we have a messy, noisy room that two people dominate. We need a rule.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,A meeting space with a screen might formalize it. But the noise will still leak.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A quiet room requires discipline. If people keep eating, it will fail.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"The kitchen option is cheaper to fit out, but the maintenance is on the users.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"A meeting space could be bookable. That stops the ""first come, first served"" chaos.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I am leaning towards a meeting space. It solves the dominance issue.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I am worried about the noise, but a bookable system might help.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,I agree. Structure is better than chaos. Let us vote on the options.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,The numbers support a meeting space if we can afford the screen.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,A meeting space gives us a place to talk properly. I support it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
